sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S3 as Amazon S3
  participant L as Lambda
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S3-)L: ObjectCreated:Put event
  L->>L: decode key (unquote_plus), parse document_id, read size and versionId
  alt size over 5 MB
    L->>API: callback status=SKIPPED, error_code=TOO_LARGE
  else within limit
    L->>S3: GetObject (VersionId)
    L->>L: extract text and counts (pdf, txt, md, csv, docx)
    L->>API: callback status=SUCCEEDED + counts + excerpt
  end
  API->>DB: find job by (document_id, s3_version_id)
  alt not found yet (upload not committed)
    API-->>L: 409 -> Lambda raises -> automatic retry
  else job not PENDING
    API-->>L: 200 already_processed (idempotent no-op)
  else job PENDING
    API->>DB: update job, finished_at
    API-->>L: 200
  end
